# Caddy reverse proxy for the game (Node listens on 127.0.0.1:8080 only).
#
# {{SITE}} is filled in by pack-release.ps1 from deploy/oracle/game-host:
#   - a hostname (e.g. mafiagame.duckdns.org) -> Caddy fetches and renews a
#     Let's Encrypt certificate itself, serves HTTPS on 443 and redirects 80 -> 443.
#     Ports 80 AND 443 must be open (OCI security list + VM iptables): 80 is
#     needed for the certificate challenge.
#   - empty -> ":80", plain HTTP on the bare IP (old behaviour).
{{SITE}} {
	encode gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}
